        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Paulo amaliilisia ali, “Nono, mukhoyeele mumanye muli burume bwe buonia bwa Wele buno, bwarumirwe khu Be Chikholo. Balaburekeeresia!”",
          "type": "text",
