              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elwachanga ke bubwami bwa Wele ne khukhwekisia kamakhuwa ko Mwami Yesu Kristo mu bunyindaafu, ne mu bulekhuule.",
          "type": "text",
